{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [{ "text": "Accessibility Statement" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        { "text": "PagoPA S.p.A. — DRAFTED ON JULY 02, 2026", "bold": true }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "PagoPA S.p.A. is committed to making its website accessible, in accordance with Legislative Decree 10 August 2018, n. 106, which transposed Directive (EU) 2016/2102 of the European Parliament and of the Council."
        }
      ]
    },
    { "type": "heading", "level": 3, "content": [{ "text": "Website" }] },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [{ "text": "Name: Knodia (service prototype)" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [
        { "text": "URL: " },
        { "text": "https://knodia.org", "url": "https://knodia.org" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [
        { "text": "Reference technical specifications used: WCAG 2.1" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Section 1 - Content in Compliance with EU Implementing Decision 2018/1523"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [{ "text": "Compliance Status: Partially compliant" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [{ "text": "Non-compliance with Law 4/2004: Yes" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": [{ "text": "Non-compliant Sections, Content, and Functions" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The Company has conducted an initial cycle of internal technical checks using open-source automatic validation tools (specifically, Google Lighthouse). Please note that these tests represent a preliminary analysis and do not replace a full and thorough manual audit. Consequently, the list of non-compliance criteria reported below includes only the evidence detected by this first automated activity and the critical issues already known internally, which are being actively worked on from a continuous improvement perspective:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "WCAG 2.1 Criteria - 1.1.1 Non-text Content, 4.1.2 Name, Role, Value, 2.4.4 Link Purpose (In Context)",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ": Buttons do not have an accessible name and links do not have a discernible name."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "WCAG 2.1 Criteria - 1.3.1 Info and Relationships, 2.4.6 Headings and Labels, 2.4.10 Section Headings",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ": Heading elements are not in a sequentially-descending order."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "WCAG 2.1 Criteria - 2.1.1 Keyboard, 2.4.3 Focus Order, 4.1.2 Name, Role, Value",
          "bold": true
        },
        { "text": ": Interactive element is not focusable." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "WCAG 2.1 Criteria - 1.4.3 Contrast (Minimum), 1.4.11 Non-text Contrast",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": ": Background and foreground colors do not have a sufficient contrast ratio."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": [{ "text": "Additional Information" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [{ "text": "Disproportionate Burden: No" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [
        { "text": "Content outside the scope of applicable legislation: No" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [{ "text": "Accessible Alternatives: Not present" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": [{ "text": "Method Used to Draft the Accessibility Statement" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [{ "text": "Method: Self-assessment carried out by the entity" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "marker": "●",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Was the analysis carried out using the AgID self-assessment model? No"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": [{ "text": "Feedback and Contact Information" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The user can notify the service provider of any cases of non-compliance with accessibility requirements, or request information and content that have been excluded from the scope of application of the directive."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The feedback mechanism can be accessed through all communication channels made available by the Service Provider. For specific reports related to the Infrastructure, users can refer to the dedicated assistance web page."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": [{ "text": "Contact Email" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        { "text": "The mailbox " },
        { "email": "interop-assistenza-accessibilita@pagopa.it" },
        {
          "text": " has been created, to which all internal and external reports regarding accessibility can be addressed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": [{ "text": "Feedback Mechanism" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "https://signup.knodia.com/ui/terms-and-conditions",
          "url": "https://signup.knodia.com/ui/terms-and-conditions"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": [{ "text": "Accessibility Officer (RTD)" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [{ "email": "segreteriagenerale@pagopa.it" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 4,
      "content": [{ "text": "Enforcement Procedure" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "(Pursuant to Art. 3-quinquies, paragraph 3, Law 9 January 2004, n. 4 as amended)",
          "italic": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The user can send a report to the Digital Ombudsman, established pursuant to Art. 17 paragraph 1-quater of the CAD, exclusively following an unsatisfactory response or lack of response to the feedback notified to the service provider."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
